.TH BIOKIDS\-AI\-SETUP 8 2026\-10\-03 "biokids 0.1.0" "BioKids"
.SH NAME
biokids\-ai\-setup \- download and check the BioKids assistant's models
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B biokids\-ai\-setup
.RB [ \-\-models\-dir
.IR dir ]
.B status
.br
.B biokids\-ai\-setup
.RB [ \-\-models\-dir
.IR dir ]
.B download
.RB [ \-\-chat
.IR key ]
.RB [ \-\-stt
.IR key ]
.br
.B biokids\-ai\-setup
.RB [ \-\-models\-dir
.IR dir ]
.B remove
.SH DESCRIPTION
The assistant's models are not part of any package. When a parent presses
\(lqDownload\(rq in the panel, the daemon starts
.BR biokids\-ai\-setup.service ,
which runs this command as the
.B biokids\-ai
user. It picks the best chat model and speech model this computer's memory
allows, fetches each from Hugging Face pinned to a commit, and checks it
against its SHA\-256 before using it; a file that does not match is deleted.
An interrupted download resumes.
.PP
Every model it offers is under the Apache\-2.0 or MIT licence. A computer with
less than 7 GB of memory is offered none.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
What is installed, selected and recommended, as JSON.
.TP
.B download
Fetch the recommended models, or the ones named with
.B \-\-chat
and
.BR \-\-stt .
.TP
.B remove
Delete every model file.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /var/lib/biokids\-ai/models
The default
.IR dir .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR biokids\-ai (8)
